WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.680
Right. The built in ontology agent

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.220
does not operate with some omnipotent

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.480
master key. It uses the signed

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.379
in users specific identity.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.620
It operates strictly within the boundaries

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.040
of that user's existing preconfigured

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.640
access rights to the underlying source

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.119
databases.
